      "writtenOn": "2026-04-23T12:47:13Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Indeed - good catch. Actually I think that both pvmfw and ramoops should not be bigger than 4MB (pvmfw is about 1MB on android and it is quite unlikely it will grow beyond 2MB, ramoops typically is not big either, typically up to 1MB. So perhaps instead of counting for 1GB extra it would be enough to target for 64MB extra for both and leaving some margin.\n\nThen extending `pkvm_hyp_pgtable_pages` about `... + __pkvm_pgtable_max_pages(SZ_64M \u003e\u003e PAGE_SHIFT)` should be enough. WDYT?",
      "parentUuid": "aa1758ce_bbdc2e53",
      "revId": "63d7a8153a3a95fb0ade5b5837caa0f1c2149e9f",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
